  "why_10_became_1": "All nine wired-capable entries now execute and pass; only the out-of-pivot binary remains. The seven deferred_fixture_or_defect binaries were repaired -- and every one failed for a PRODUCTION defect, not fixture rot: facilities decoded sum(bigint) NUMERIC into i64 and separately bound kwh as String into NUMERIC; compliance put Option<i64> behind serde(flatten), which serde_urlencoded cannot deserialize, so ?limit=/?offset= 400'd in the extractor on five catalog routes; facilities pre-gated create/get/list on authorize_org_wide, collapsing FacilitiesManage [D,D,D,A,D,A] and FacilitiesObserve [D,A,A,A,A,A] to SUPER_ADMIN and locking out every branch-scoped ADMIN; consulting emitted a nine-element array where OpenAPI declares string/date-time; benefit made Option<Date> fields mandatory; identity ordered a directory page by an unqualified column with the collation pinned nowhere; logistics shipped a CHECK regex exceeding RE_DUP_MAX so no POD could ever be written, which in turn masked a terminal-state trigger that made SETTLED unreachable. deferred_needs_postgres_lane (platform/db) and deferred_feature_variant (platform/auth-rest) needed NO source change -- they were dark purely for want of a postgres-cargo-map entry, and are now wired as platform-db-lib-pg and auth-rest-lib-pg. Each retirement is an entry removed because its binary now EXECUTES, never a count adjusted.",
  "why_one_entry_remains": "backend/crates/platform/storage/tests/seaweedfs_worm.rs stays named, by explicit owner decision. It is not analogous to code deleted by the pivot: platform/storage/src/lib.rs still ships and is depended on by backend/app (src/mail_sync.rs), comms/application and comms/rest. The test asserts an object-lock/WORM retention guarantee on live code and is #[ignore]d, so it consumes no CI time. Deleting it would be coverage loss, not hygiene -- and removing a compliance-retention test while compliance is on HOLD converts a known gap into an unknown one. A literal zero is only reachable by deleting a live-code compliance test, so one named and sanctioned entry is the truthful end state."
}
